# Pairs with RoutingConverges. The survivor still carries the slot in its
# permanent moved-away seal, so the shard the map now routes k2 to refuses
# it for ever.
MODULE: RoutingConvergesFoldSkipsReclaim
TARGET: RoutingConverges
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the fold moves the map back onto the survivor without reclaiming the slot from its seal
PERTURBS: MigCommit

--- FIND
    /\ sealed' = IF mk = "fold" THEN [sealed EXCEPT ![dst] = FALSE] ELSE sealed
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no reclaim.
    /\ sealed' = sealed
--- END
